	(text "- Use pulse rated ceramic capacitor and pulse rated resistors\n- Add another MOSFET in parallel. See if you can control it using one gate driver \n- Replace the terminal block with a scew connector\n- I can use a single gate driver to drive 2 MOSFETS, but that would affect the rise time\n- The bootstrap Capacitor should be changed to a lower value (Done through clculation)\n- Aim for the diode to have a very low power dissipation and have ut as a big package (13xx or sum)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.882 175.514 0)
		(effects
